    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.icons\n\n### Description\n\nCurrently, there are a few plugins that are not compatible with mini.icons, so you need to enable mock_nvim_web_devicons(). This should serve as a compatibility layer, and users should always be able to use the MiniIcons global variable.",
